OL,3,ATwelve people, aged 19 to 61, arrested
OL,4,Aafter Middlesbrough crash that killed
OL,5,Atwo police officers
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo police officers were killed when a
OL,8,FVolkswagen Passat collided with their
OL,9,Fmarked car around 03:30 BST on Saturday
OL,10,F- the five people in the other vehicle
OL,11,Fwere also killed
OL,13,FFour of the five people in the car had
OL,14,Fprevious convictions. One of the five,
OL,15,F18-year-old Makai Saddington,
OL,16,Fpreviously pleaded guilty to assaulting
OL,17,Fa police officer
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
